A jar built with the map contains, under web/, the built map of Heroic Map
Renderer (Apache-2.0, same publisher). Its NOTICE, LICENSE and the licenses
of the third-party code in it are in web/lizenzen.txt.

A jar built with network access contains, under renderer/, the binary of
Heroic Map Renderer for its platform, Windows or Linux (Apache-2.0, same
publisher), from the release named in renderer/renderer.properties. Its
LICENSE and NOTICE and the licenses of the third-party code in it,
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES and COPYRIGHT-library.html, are in renderer/.

The jar contains, under com/nekyia/heroicmap/bstats/, bStats Metrics 3.2.1
(MIT License, Copyright (c) 2021 Bastian Oppermann), renamed from
org.bstats. Its license is in META-INF/LICENSE-bstats.txt.

